translate schinese_rewrite main_green_forest_f3df80e5:

    # gt "Hey, you! What is your purpose of travel?"
    gt "嘿，你！你来这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_green_forest_e31207d0:

    # e "Just exploring!"
    e "只是到处逛逛！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_green_forest_612a17d9:

    # gt "Oh, alright. You're that courier... I am sent here to guard over Lusterfield, so we just wanted to make sure no one suspicious enters."
    gt "你是那个信使,我被派来守卫乐斯民菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_green_forest_6d7a8709:

    # e "Alright, I get it! Thanks for the heads up!"
    e "好吧，我明白了！谢谢你提醒我！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_cbb6bd7c:

    # "Once more, you've discovered the same sprout, this time it's much bigger, with a yellowish fruit under the usual two leaves."
    "你又发现了那株小芽，这一次它大了许多，平常的两片叶子下面还结着一颗淡黄色的果实。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_c6157549:

    # "It has mostly blended in with the other firs on the tree, almost as if it belongs here."
    "它几乎和树上其他冷杉融为一体，仿佛本来就属于这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_f84659d4:

    # "You reach up to grab onto the sprout, and suddenly, a familiar voice catches your attention."
    "你伸手想抓住那株小芽，突然，一个熟悉的声音吸引了你的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_44276ca5:

    # h "What do you think you're doing, kiddo."
    h "你这是在做什么，小家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_6be92e1e:

    # "It was Haskell, the old dragon walks up from his small hut."
    "原来是哈斯克尔，那条老龙从他的小屋里走了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_345648fb:

    # e "Uh... I was picking up herbs, can I not... do that?"
    e "呃……我只是来采草药的，难道……不行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_7f25484a:

    # "Haskell looks at the direction of your hand, a squirming sprout still bouncing around your palm."
    "哈斯克尔看向你伸出的手，那株扭动的小芽还在你的掌心里蹦跶。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_c9ee51ff:

    # h "Did the goat shopkeeper send you here?"
    h "是那个山羊商店老板让你来的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_fdc766f3:

    # e "Well I was looking for a trinket, called eversprout, Gwyd gave me the clues to find it and I followed the fruit here."
    e "我是在找一种叫作永生芽的魔法饰品，格维德给了我寻找它的线索，我就一路跟着果实找到了这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_95c1ecbb:

    # "The dragon sighs, he walks towards you until you're both under the fir trees."
    "龙叹了口气，朝你走来，直到你们一起站在冷杉树下。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_790310bb:

    # h "Ugh, what did he tell you exactly."
    h "啧，他到底跟你说了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_0c6a1960:

    # e "He just sold me a scroll- Wait, do you know about the sprout?"
    e "他只是卖给我一张卷轴——等等，你知道这株小芽的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_78d92e77:

    # "You loosen up your fist, and the sprout quickly bounces to Haskell's side."
    "你松开拳头，小芽立刻蹦到哈斯克尔身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_93c6cb34:

    # "He pats on the leaves for a moment, before letting it return to the bristling trees."
    "他轻轻拍了拍叶子，然后任由它回到那些蓬乱的树丛中。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_a1ce6a51:

    # h "Of course I do! The sprout's from my garden, helps with tending to the herbs and flowers."
    h "当然知道！这株小芽来自我的花园，平时会帮我照料草药和花朵。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_d75f0564:

    # h "He's a budding spirit, one born just like the other soulful trinkets, but he has his own mind."
    h "它是一个初生的灵体，和其他有灵性的魔法饰品一样诞生，但它有自己的意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_4cf86ea3:

    # e "I thought those three trinkets were all you know."
    e "我还以为那三件魔法饰品就是全部了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_2381274b:

    # h "It's not like I'll gladly let you take my garden tender and put it in a glass bottle, ugh..."
    h "我可不会乐意让你把我的花园帮手装进玻璃瓶里，啧……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_2018efa8:

    # "Haskell takes another sip, before he casually walks into the garden and returns with a sprout."
    "哈斯克尔又喝了一口茶，然后若无其事地走进花园，带着一株小芽回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_e5e7b6f9:

    # h "Here, take it."
    h "给，拿去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_959bb4a2:

    # e "Oh? What's this...?"
    e "哦？这是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_c7897e01:

    # h "One of the sprouts that the spirit has stayed with, it should invoke a similar effect as though it was one of the trinkets."
    h "这是那灵体寄居过的其中一株小芽，应该也能产生类似魔法饰品的效果。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_72c73954:

    # h "The result is reduced, but just as spiritual as the real one."
    h "效果会弱一些，但和真正的魔法饰品一样具有灵性。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_b73b6cb7:

    # e "Thank you so much, Haskell."
    e "太谢谢你了，哈斯克尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_bd41a4e6:

    # h "Well, next time Gwyddyon wants to sell you my own items, remember to stuff his mouth with his worthless crystals."
    h "下次格维德恩还想把我的东西卖给你时，记得用他那些一文不值的水晶把他的嘴堵上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_69491b20:

    # h "Now, let me finish my tea, and don't try to look for the young sprout anymore, kiddo. He's going to be scared of you for a while."
    h "现在，让我把茶喝完。小家伙，别再去找那株小芽了，它暂时会怕你一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_alchemists_cabin_cd2aa067:

    # "You nod, before Haskell chuckles slightly and returns to his hut."
    "你点点头，哈斯克尔轻笑一声，回到了他的小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_134a4208:

    # "Under the old outpost of the goats, you discover the hidden sprout once more, it wiggles as always, rhythm on the pace with the nature's frequency."
    "在山羊族的旧前哨下，你再次发现了那株藏起来的小芽。它一如既往地扭动着，节奏与自然的律动合拍。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_c3d914a9:

    # e "Don't you fuckin run away again!"
    e "你他妈的别再跑了！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_554537ac:

    # "You angrily catches it, this time the small sprout is trapped right in your palm."
    "你气冲冲地抓住了它，这一次，小芽被牢牢困在你的掌心里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_65ab4a45:

    # e "Haha, YES!"
    e "哈哈，抓到了！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_e327378a:

    # "The small sprout convulses, jiggling as if it was hurt by your force. Your eyes widen, and immediately relaxes your hand."
    "小芽抽搐起来，像是被你的力道弄疼了似的不断颤动。你瞪大眼睛，立刻松开了手。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_72d88318:

    # "Suddenly it jumps off your hand, you try to catch it once more but as soon as it touches the ground, it has vanished once more."
    "它突然从你手里跳了出去。你又试着抓住它，可它一落地，便再次消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_b57712fd:

    # "You stomp the ground impatiently, it's unbelievable how it manipulated with your empathy just to escape."
    "你不耐烦地跺着脚。难以置信，它居然利用你的同情心来逃跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_2c3b668e:

    # "But there's no time for your frustration, you should chase after it again. Just that the problem is, there's no way to know where it went..."
    "但你没时间继续懊恼，应该再追上去。问题是，你根本不知道它跑到哪里去了……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_21d7e940:

    # "You walk over to the entrance of the goat tribe, two guards are standing there."
    "你走到山羊族入口，那里站着两名守卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_4a5579c6:

    # "One of them immediately rushes inside, and a moment later, the general walks out towards you, still exhausted."
    "其中一人立刻冲了进去，片刻后，将军朝你走来，看起来依旧疲惫不堪。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_78c284fa:

    # k "Hey... Where's Furkan?"
    k "Hey... Where's 弗坎?"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_cca30a87:

    # e "He's fine, he told me to ask your guards to take him back."
    e "他没事，他让我请你们的守卫把他带回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_c2205134:

    # "Kari looks at you with surprise."
    "卡里惊讶地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_dcd86e92:

    # k "Oh?"
    k "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_c52956bf:

    # k "Alright... Thanks, Courier."
    k "好吧……谢谢你，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_57642efc:

    # "You can sense a sliver of gratitude in his voice, even when he doesn't spell it out loud."
    "即使他没有明说，你还是能从他的声音里察觉到一丝感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_82c5b073:

    # k "You should get some rest, I'll take over now."
    k "你应该去休息一会儿，我现在来接手。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_f9973791:

    # "He hands you some paper."
    "他递给你几张纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_94e12146:

    # k "Here's some recipe I thought should prove useful to you."
    k "这是我觉得对你会很有用的几张配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_44668cc5:

    # k "It's iron sword and axe."
    k "铁剑和铁斧的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_4509fa69:

    # e "Ah, that sounds so great. Thanks a lot!"
    e "啊，太好了。多谢！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_f622bd2d:

    # k "We'll talk later, both of us need to recover for a while."
    k "我们之后再聊，我们俩都需要休养一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_88472ec0:

    # e "See you!"
    e "回头见！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_56af5341:

    # "You reach the gate of the goat tribe, the guards looks at you in confusion."
    "你来到山羊族的大门前，守卫们困惑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_135a5f89:

    # "It seems that there's no one in charge of the goat tribe now."
    "看来现在已经没人负责山羊族的事务了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_d7796cd2:

    # "The general is still in the cave, as you presume."
    "正如你所料，将军还在洞穴里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_bb213eab:

    # "The general is taking his rest."
    "将军正在休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_da9cd745:

    # "And the chief is still inside the cave."
    "而首领还在洞穴里。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_woodland_outpost_146c26b8:

    # "You decide that the guards won't let you in, and you move on back to the main road."
    "你认定守卫不会让你进去，于是转身回到主路上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_mossy_freshwater_f68a08be:

    # "Just in the cave of the mossy river, you find the same sprout again, it wiggles again, convulsing with the flow of the water."
    "就在长满苔藓的河流洞穴里，你又发现了同一株小芽。它再次扭动起来，随着水流一阵阵抽搐。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_mossy_freshwater_cdc43bd0:

    # "You walk towards the river bank, before it slips away from the grasp of your hand, and wiggles away again."
    "你朝河岸走去，它却从你的手中滑脱，再次扭动着逃走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_mossy_freshwater_436b3870:

    # e "Argh! How did it escape again?"
    e "啊！它怎么又逃掉了？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_mossy_freshwater_4706c9aa:

    # "You turn your head left and right, there's no sign of which direction it had went, but you should chase after it before it disappears once more."
    "你左右转头，完全看不出它往哪个方向跑了，但你得在它再次消失前追上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite ancient_tree_chop_b54e12b4:

    # "You chop off some wood from a nearby tree. You have collected [chopped_wood] Wooden Log."
    "你从附近的树上砍下一些木头。你收集到了 [chopped_wood] 根木头。"

translate schinese_rewrite ancient_tree_chop_b201a95a:

    # "You have lost [lost_hp] HP in total."
    "你总共损失了 [lost_hp] 点生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite ancient_tree_chop_176da485:

    # "You don't have enough hp for you to keep draining your energy on chopping wood, you decide it is better for you to continue on your path."
    "你的生命值不足，无法继续用砍树消耗体力，于是决定继续赶路。"

translate schinese_rewrite ancient_tree_chop_a229b0ad:

    # "You look through your bag, there's nothing for you to chop the wood except for your hand. You would probably need an axe for this occasion."
    "你翻遍背包，除了徒手以外没有任何能砍木头的东西。这种时候你大概需要一把斧头。"

translate schinese_rewrite tree_chopping_8bd7ba34:

    # "You have lost too much hp to continue chopping wood."
    "你损失了太多生命值，无法继续砍树。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_e8ac8bd3:

    # "You pour the minotaur's essence in the pond, drops and drops of the white liquid mixes with the water."
    "你把牛头怪的精华倒进池塘，白色液体一滴又一滴地与水混合。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_5dd59d30:

    # "Soon, you see... the water clears up and a strange plant begin to surface from the water."
    "很快，你看到……水变清了，一株奇异的植物开始从水中浮现。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_8ae79518:

    # "You can feel the effect of the flower as soon as you touch it, it must be a trinket."
    "你一碰到它就能感受到其中的力量，它一定是件魔法饰品。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_7eacecbf:

    # "You store it carefully in your bag. And thank the water before getting up."
    "你小心地把它收进背包，然后起身前向水面道谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_868d48c6:

    # "When you look closely, you realise it was just a herb of grace..."
    "仔细一看，你才发现那只是一株恩典草……"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_b0710454:

    # "You put the plant in your bag and continue with your adventure."
    "你把植物放进背包，继续你的冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_484eb984:

    # "You drink from the lagoon with your bucket, the refreshing power of the water recovered a portion of your HP and MP."
    "你用水桶舀起泻湖的水喝下，清凉的水流恢复了你的一部分生命值和魔法值。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_1778dec4:

    # "You look through your bag, nothing can hold enough water for you to drink, you realise that you need a water bucket. Discouraged, you continue on your track."
    "你翻遍背包，没有什么能装下足够的水供你饮用。你意识到自己需要一个水桶，只好沮丧地继续赶路。"

translate schinese_rewrite sparkling_lagoon_drink_d45e1edf:

    # "You look at the lagoon, your stomach is still full of water right now. You need to take some time before drinking from the lagoon again."
    "你看着泻湖，此刻你的肚子里还装满了水。你需要过一会儿才能再次饮用泻湖的水。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_e59928dc:

    # "You look around the green forest for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在绿林中环顾了一会儿，但附近似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_6795ba31:

    # "As you are searching through the forest, a green mass lunges itself into you from an innocent bush, covering you in slimy substance."
    "你搜寻森林时，一团绿色的东西从一株无害的灌木中猛扑向你，把你浑身都覆盖上了黏液。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_ef997b7d:

    # "You struggle and flail your arms, flinging the mass away from you. It turns out to be a green slime as your vision becomes clear."
    "你挣扎着挥动双臂，把那团东西甩开。视线恢复后，你才发现那是一只绿色史莱姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_ec9039c2:

    # "You look around the green forest, under the bright sun you see something tinted red in the bush, you went and pick it up. It was a red berry."
    "你在明亮的阳光下环顾绿林，看到灌木丛里有一抹红色，便走过去把它捡了起来。原来是一颗红浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_3a490989:

    # "You put the red berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] red berry."
    "你把红浆果放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 颗红浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_88e4ec00:

    # "You put the red berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] red berries."
    "你把红浆果放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 颗红浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_7f533c9c:

    # "You look around the green forest, under the bright sun you see something tinted blue in the bush, you went and pick it up. It was a blue berry."
    "你在明亮的阳光下环顾绿林，看到灌木丛里有一抹蓝色，便走过去把它捡了起来。原来是一颗蓝浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_b2dcd073:

    # "You put the blue berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] blue berry."
    "你把蓝浆果放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 颗蓝浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_c44940ab:

    # "You put the blue berry in your bag, you now have [item_number] blue berries."
    "你把蓝浆果放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 颗蓝浆果。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_89ec9253:

    # "As you walk around the forest, you discovered an abandoned dirt path covered with leaves, the path seems to be forgotten for a long while, except for a pair of footprint."
    "你在森林里行走时，发现了一条被落叶覆盖的废弃土路。这条路似乎已经被遗忘很久了，只有一对脚印表明曾有人走过。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_a49cea3d:

    # "You walk along the trail, it takes you a few minutes to reach the end, where you see a giant ancient tree at the middle of it. You decide to check the surrounding area for a while."
    "你沿着小径走了几分钟，来到尽头，看见一棵巨大的古树立在路中央。你决定在周围查看一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_e59928dc_1:

    # "You look around the green forest for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在绿林中环顾了一会儿，但附近似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_511df20f:

    # "While you are walking through the forest, you feel as if there's something on your left foot, you look down, and realise it is a rock."
    "你穿过森林时，感觉左脚上像踩到了什么东西。你低头一看，原来是一块石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_e1ac0667:

    # e "It must be the rock... no, stone that Sebas asked me to collect."
    e "一定是那块石头……不，是塞巴斯让我收集的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_18961dfc:

    # e "I think I have enough ...stone now. I gotta go back and report to Sebas."
    e "我想我已经收集到足够多的……石头了。得回去向塞巴斯报告。"

translate schinese_rewrite green_forest_loop_e7c8eaf3:

    # "You put the stone into your bag, you now have [item_number] stones."
    "你把石头放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 块石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite summery_farmland_loop_f5a6843c:

    # "You come across a barley field in the farmland, you use your scythe and pick up a crop of barley."
    "你在农田里遇到一片大麦田，用镰刀收割了一茬大麦。"

translate schinese_rewrite summery_farmland_loop_549261cb:

    # "You put the barley in your bag, you now have [item_number] barleys."
    "你把大麦放进背包，现在有 [item_number] 份大麦。"

